; ACCEPTED: arcs and their direction, Y UP the
; wall (D1).
; Pen DOWN, so the paper shows it: from (0,0)
; to (40,0) with
; I20, G2 (clockwise) must pass ABOVE the
; start, G3 BELOW.
; Expected ink: an S-like figure, upper half
; then lower half.
M5
G90 G0 X0 Y0
G21 G17 G54 G94
M3
; G2: clockwise, passes above (+Y)
G2 X40 Y0 I20 J0
; G3 back to the start: counter-clockwise from
; the right,
; it goes above again; a full lens
G3 X0 Y0 I-20 J0
; G3 away to the right: below
G3 X40 Y0 I20 J0
; G2 back: below again
G2 X0 Y0 I-20 J0
M5
G0 X0 Y-60
M3
; full circle R20: end point = start point,
; centre at (0,-80)
G2 X0 Y-60 I0 J-20
M5
G0 X60 Y-60
M3
; G3 full circle, centre (60,-80)
G3 X60 Y-60 I0 J-20
M5
G0 X-60 Y-60
M3
